IShoppingMallOrderItemSnapshotVariantOpt.description:
Variant option key-value pair captured in an order item snapshot at the time of purchase.

This type represents a single attribute of a product variant as it existed when the order was placed. Each variant can have multiple options (e.g., color, size, material), and each option is stored as a separate key-value pair. The snapshot ensures these options remain visible for order history, fulfillment, and dispute resolution even if the seller later modifies or deletes the product variant.

Examples:
- {key: 'color', value: 'Red'}
- {key: 'size', value: 'Large'}
- {key: 'material', value: 'Cotton'}

