   *    - order_item_id
   *    - product_snapshot (name, description, category_id, base_price)
   *    - variant_snapshot (sku_code, price, options)
   *    - seller_profile_snapshot (shop_name, logo)
   *    - created_at
   *
   * 6. Handle edge cases:
   *    - Return empty result set if no matching snapshots found
   *    - Validate date range parameters
   *    - Ensure proper authorization checks before returning data
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Patch()
  public async index(
    @CustomerAuth()
    customer: CustomerPayload,
    @TypedBody()
    body: IShoppingMallOrderItemSnapshot.IRequest,
  ): Promise<IPageIShoppingMallOrderItemSnapshot.ISummary> {
